{"out": "S0E9_bones", "end": "حدا قلّكن إنّو الكلى بتأثّر عالعضم؟", "endsub": "Did anyone tell you kidneys affect your bones?", "lines": [{"who": "Wadad", "ar": "سمعتي؟ العضم زعلان منّا.", "en": "Heard? The bones are upset with us.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.33, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "أكيد زعلان! صرت متل البسكوتة!", "en": "Of course I'm upset! I've become like a biscuit!", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/refs/bone_master.jpg", "z": [1.0, 1.15, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "نحنا كنّا نظبط الكالسيوم والفوسفور. لمّا تعبنا، الفوسفور صار يعلى…", "en": "We used to balance calcium and phosphorus. When we got tired, phosphorus went up…", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.66, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "والغدّة الزغيرة بالرقبة صارت تسحب الكالسيوم من العضم.", "en": "And the little gland in the neck started pulling calcium out of the bones.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_thief.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.6, 0.6], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "سرقة! سرقة عالمكشوف!", "en": "Robbery! In broad daylight!", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_out.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "وهلّق؟ تحاليل، فيتامين دال إذا الفريق قال، ورياضة خفيفة. عم نرمّم.", "en": "Now? Blood tests, vitamin D if the team says so, gentle exercise. We're rebuilding.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_build.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e9_l06.mp3"}]}